        {
          "id": "1e64ca8a-d725-3502-bfc4-efc3e1318bbc",
          "content": {
            "id": "1e64ca8a-d725-3502-bfc4-efc3e1318bbc",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Nvidia\u2013xAI boosts chip stocks, Equifax strikes back against FICO",
            "description": "<p>Yahoo Finance anchor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/\">Julie Hyman</a> outlines three of Wednesday's top stories on Wall Street as part of <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute</a>.</p>\n<p>Chip stocks continue to rise on <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/nvidia-invest-musk-xai-part-231116143.html\">Bloomberg reports</a> \u2014 now confirmed by <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/elon-musks-xai-raise-20b-140650221.html\">Nvidia</a> (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>) CEO Jensen Huang \u2014 that Nvidia is among the investors financing the <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/elon-musks-xai-raise-20b-140650221.html\">latest funding round</a> for Tesla (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/TSLA\">TSLA</a>) CEO Elon Musk's artificial intelligence (AI) company, xAI (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/XAAI.PVT\">XAAI.PVT</a>).</p>\n<p>Equifax (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/EFX\">EFX</a>) stock surges after the company cut its credit score data prices, striking back against FICO (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:10;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/FICO\">FICO</a>).</p>\n<p>AST Spacemobile (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:11;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ASTS\">ASTS</a>) stock skyrockets on news of the company's deal with Verizon (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:12;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/VZ\">VZ</a>).</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:13;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
            "summary": "Yahoo Finance anchor Julie Hyman outlines three of Wednesday's top stories on Wall Street as part of Yahoo Finance's Market Minute. Chip stocks continue to rise on Bloomberg reports \u2014 now confirmed by Nvidia (NVDA) CEO Jensen Huang \u2014 that Nvidia is among the investors financing the latest funding round for Tesla (TSLA) CEO Elon Musk's artificial intelligence (AI) company, xAI (XAAI.PVT). Equifax (EFX) stock surges after the company cut its credit score data prices, striking back against FICO (FICO). AST Spacemobile (ASTS) stock skyrockets on news of the company's deal with Verizon (VZ). Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.",
